# Ajani Unrelenting: "Whenever you activate a loyalty ability, create a 2/2 colorless Wizard Soldier creature token named Cadet."
# On turn 3 Bot1 activates the -2 (loyalty 5 to 3). With the trigger and the -2 on the stack, Bot2 Lightning Bolts Ajani: 3
# damage removes his last 3 loyalty counters and he dies (CR 306.8, 704.5i). Both abilities are independent of their source once
# on the stack (CR 113.7a): the trigger still makes its Cadet, and then the -2 discards Bot1's hand (three Plains) and draws one
# card for the one creature he controls, the Cadet.

